-math math-inline\">\\tau(2,3)</code> (trefoil)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e^- / e^+</code>; on divisor: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{u}/\\mathfrak{d}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{1,0}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(2,5)</code> (cinquefoil)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mu</code>; on divisor: gen-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code> quarks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{1,0}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(2,7)</code> (septafoil)</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code>-lepton; on divisor: gen-<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3</code> quarks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{1,0}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(3,5)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Weak force (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>-decay vertex)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{0,1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(2,9) = \\tau(2,3^2)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Strong binding (gluon)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{0,1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau(3,4) = \\tau(3,2^2)</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Hopf<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">{}^2</code> binding (color)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{0,1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1</code> (figure-eight)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Higgs field (mass mechanism)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H^{0,1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">4_1^{-1} = 4_1</code> (amphichiral)</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Higgs field <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">=</code> own antiparticle</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/cohomological-embedding-table2-data.md","heading":"Table"}
